1025	 *      `$member`, an already-attributed `person`, …) — return it. A single
1026	 *      {@link lookupMatches} covers all types because an identity value is
1027	 *      globally unique to one entity; no `$member`-before-`person` ordering.
1028	 *      Never mint a `$member` here (membership provisioning owns that, so
